lm(y ~ w)     :   yhat = B0 + B2 * w
lm(y ~ x + w) :   yhat = B0 + B1 * x + B2 * w
lm(y ~ x * w) :   yhat = B0 + B1 * x + B2 * w + B3 * x * w

