Hi Jeremy,
se only applies to the smooth geom. This works

qplot(carat, price, data = dsmall, geom='point')+geom_smooth(se=F)

But in general it is better to use ggplot and to use qplot only for quick and dirty plots.
Success!
Frans (DigiPsy)

