Based on the error message, I split it into three calls to geom_hline:

p <- ggplot(df_melt, aes(mean, diff)) +
      geom_point(na.rm=TRUE) +

      geom_hline(data=df2,aes(yintercept=round(mean,3)),linetype=1,
