install.packages(c("reshape2", "digest")) will get you where you want to be.

Also, if you're wanting to put multiple plots in one window, check out the gridExtra package.  Example below.

library(ggplot2)
library(gridExtra)
p1 <- qplot(rnorm(1e1))
p2 <- qplot(rnorm(1e2))
p3 <- qplot(rnorm(1e3))
p4 <- qplot(rnorm(1e4))
marrangeGrob(list(p1, p2, p3, p4), nrow = 2, ncol = 2, top = "")

Cheers
david.

